    "0VD-cw-OzF.text" : {
      "comment" : "Class = \"UILabel\"; text = \"After you quit smoking, you might find it a bit tricky to get a good night's sleep at first. But don't worry, it gets better! If it's really bothering you, talk to your healthcare provider—they can help. Because if you're super tired from not sleeping well, it can make it tougher to stay smoke-free.\\n\\nHere's how you can manage it:\"; ObjectID = \"0VD-cw-OzF\";",
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "After you quit smoking, you might find it a bit tricky to get a good night's sleep at first. But don't worry, it gets better! If it's really bothering you, talk to your healthcare provider—they can help. Because if you're super tired from not sleeping well, it can make it tougher to stay smoke-free.\n\nHere's how you can manage it:"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Después de dejar de fumar, podrías encontrar un poco difícil dormir bien al principio. Pero no te preocupes, ¡esto mejora con el tiempo! Si realmente te está molestando, habla con tu médico; ellos pueden ayudarte. Porque si estás muy cansado por no dormir bien, puede ser más difícil mantenerte libre del cigarrillo.  Aquí tienes cómo manejarlo:\n"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1CS-Tp-ypj.text" : {
