    "A2h-us-13o.text" : {
      "comment" : "Class = \"UILabel\"; text = \"Research has shown an important association between alcohol consumption and breast cancer—for each 10 grams of alcohol consumed (less than 1 standard drink) on an average daily basis, a woman’s chance of developing postmenopausal breast cancer increases by around 9 percent. \"; ObjectID = \"A2h-us-13o\";",
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Research has shown an important association between alcohol consumption and breast cancer—for each 10 grams of alcohol consumed (less than 1 standard drink) on an average daily basis, a woman’s chance of developing postmenopausal breast cancer increases by around 9 percent. "
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "• Investigaciones han demostrado una importante asociación entre el consumo de alcohol y el cáncer de mama; por cada 10 gramos de alcohol consumido (menos de 1 bebida estándar) en promedio al día, la probabilidad de que una mujer desarrolle cáncer de mama postmenopáusico aumenta alrededor del 9%.\n"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "a2R-j5-tcO.text" : {
      "comment" : "Class = \"UILabel\"; text = \"Then you're trying to quit smoking, it's totally normal to feel a bit irritated or grouchy. Even folks who never smoked get it - it's just part of the quitting process. So, don't worry, you're not alone in feeling this way.\\n\\nHere's how to deal with it:\"; ObjectID = \"a2R-j5-tcO\";",
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Then you're trying to quit smoking, it's totally normal to feel a bit irritated or grouchy. Even folks who never smoked get it - it's just part of the quitting process. So, don't worry, you're not alone in feeling this way.\n\nHere's how to deal with it:"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cuando estás intentando dejar de fumar, es totalmente normal sentirse un poco irritado o malhumorado. Incluso las personas que nunca han fumado lo entienden: es solo parte del proceso de dejar de fumar. Así que, no te preocupes, no estás solo, no eres el único que se siente así.\n                                                                           Aquí tienes cómo manejarlo:\n"
          }
        }
      }
    },
