    "aWb-Uq-N7p.text" : {
      "comment" : "Class = \"UILabel\"; text = \"Let’s use breathing exercises to support your journey. They help reduce stress and cravings, and provide a calming distraction..\"; ObjectID = \"aWb-Uq-N7p\";",
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Let’s use breathing exercises to support your journey. They help reduce stress and cravings, and provide a calming distraction.."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Usemos ejercicios de respiración para apoyar tu viaje. Ayudan a reducir el estrés, los antojos, y proporcionan calma."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "aYo-Tt-lxa.text" : {
      "comment" : "Class = \"UILabel\"; text = \"Memory problem; alcohol can impair both short-term and long-term memory. I can lead to blackouts(Can’t recall events that occurred while one is intoxicated).\"; ObjectID = \"aYo-Tt-lxa\";",
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Memory problem; alcohol can impair both short-term and long-term memory. I can lead to blackouts(Can’t recall events that occurred while one is intoxicated)."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Problemas de memoria; el alcohol puede afectar tanto la memoria a corto como a largo plazo. Puede provocar desmayos (no recordar los eventos que ocurrieron mientras se está intoxicado).\n"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "b3Y-cA-pO7.text" : {
      "comment" : "Class = \"UILabel\"; text = \"Resources\"; ObjectID = \"b3Y-cA-pO7\";",
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Resources"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Recursos"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "B4g-hn-woU.text" : {
      "comment" : "Class = \"UILabel\"; text = \"Research has also shown that alcohol misuse increases the risk of liver disease, cardiovascular  diseases, depression, and stomach bleeding, as well as cancers of the oral cavity, esophagus, larynx, pharynx, liver, colon, and rectum. \"; ObjectID = \"B4g-hn-woU\";",
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Research has also shown that alcohol misuse increases the risk of liver disease, cardiovascular  diseases, depression, and stomach bleeding, as well as cancers of the oral cavity, esophagus, larynx, pharynx, liver, colon, and rectum. "
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "• Las personas que hacen un uso indebido del alcohol también pueden tener problemas para manejar condiciones como diabetes, hipertensión, dolor y trastornos del sueño.\n"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "beN-65-v47.text" : {
      "comment" : "Class = \"UILabel\"; text = \"CAGE\"; ObjectID = \"beN-65-v47\";",
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "CAGE"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "bJ2-VW-RVx.text" : {
      "comment" : "Class = \"UILabel\"; text = \"Put on a new patch each morning to get a steady level of nicotine that will reduce your cravings and withdrawal symptoms throughout the day.\"; ObjectID = \"bJ2-VW-RVx\";",
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Put on a new patch each morning to get a steady level of nicotine that will reduce your cravings and withdrawal symptoms throughout the day."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Coloca un parche nuevo cada mañana para obtener un nivel constante de nicotina que reducirá tus deseos y síntomas de abstinencia durante el día.\n"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "bJf-QB-Tik.text" : {
      "comment" : "Class = \"UILabel\"; text = \"E-cigarettes go by many names like \\\"e-cigs,” vapes,\\\" and \\\"vape pens.\\\" They can look like regular cigarettes or even things like USB flash drives and pens.\\n\\nThese devices run on batteries and let people inhale something called aerosol. Vaping became popular because some thought it might be a less harmful choice compared to regular smoking.\\n\\nInside that aerosol, there's usually nicotine (though not always), flavors, and some other chemicals. The devices can be rechargeable, disposable, or come with tanks and mods.\\n\\nIs it safer than tobacco?\\nE-cigarette aerosol generally contains fewer toxic chemicals than the deadly mix of 7,000 chemicals in smoke from regular cigarettes. However, e-cigarette aerosol is not harmless. It can contain harmful and potentially harmful substances, including nicotine, heavy metals like lead, volatile organic compounds and cancer-causing agents.\"; ObjectID = \"bJf-QB-Tik\";",
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "E-cigarettes go by many names like \"e-cigs,” vapes,\" and \"vape pens.\" They can look like regular cigarettes or even things like USB flash drives and pens.\n\nThese devices run on batteries and let people inhale something called aerosol. Vaping became popular because some thought it might be a less harmful choice compared to regular smoking.\n\nInside that aerosol, there's usually nicotine (though not always), flavors, and some other chemicals. The devices can be rechargeable, disposable, or come with tanks and mods.\n\nIs it safer than tobacco?\nE-cigarette aerosol generally contains fewer toxic chemicals than the deadly mix of 7,000 chemicals in smoke from regular cigarettes. However, e-cigarette aerosol is not harmless. It can contain harmful and potentially harmful substances, including nicotine, heavy metals like lead, volatile organic compounds and cancer-causing agents."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Los cigarrillos electrónicos tienen muchos nombres, como \"e-cigs,\" \"vapes\" o \"lapiceros de vapeo.\" Pueden parecer cigarrillos normales o incluso parecer otras cosas como USBs o lapiceros. Estos dispositivos funcionan con baterías y permiten a las personas inhalar algo llamado aerosol. El vapeo se hizo popular porque algunos pensaron que podría ser una opción menos dañina en comparación con fumar cigarrillos normales.   Dentro de ese aerosol, generalmente hay nicotina (aunque no siempre), sabores y algunos otros químicos. Los dispositivos pueden ser recargables, desechables o venir con tanques de recarga.  ¿Es más seguro que el tabaco?  El aerosol de los cigarrillos electrónicos generalmente contiene menos químicos tóxicos que la mortal mezcla de 7,000 químicos en el humo de los cigarrillos normales. Sin embargo, el aerosol de los cigarrillos electrónicos no es inofensivo. Puede contener sustancias nocivas y potencialmente dañinas, incluyendo nicotina, metales pesados como el plomo, compuestos orgánicos volátiles y agentes cancerígenos.\n"
          }
        }
      }
    },
