    "e5K-t6-sko.text" : {
      "comment" : "Class = \"UILabel\"; text = \"Birth defects. Prenatal alcohol exposure can result in brain damage and other serious problems in babies. The effects are known as fetal alcohol spectrum disorders, or FASD, and can result in lifelong physical, cognitive, and behavioral problems. Because there is no known safe level of alcohol for a developing baby, women who are pregnant or might be pregnant should not drink.\"; ObjectID = \"e5K-t6-sko\";",
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Birth defects. Prenatal alcohol exposure can result in brain damage and other serious problems in babies. The effects are known as fetal alcohol spectrum disorders, or FASD, and can result in lifelong physical, cognitive, and behavioral problems. Because there is no known safe level of alcohol for a developing baby, women who are pregnant or might be pregnant should not drink."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "• Defectos de nacimiento. La exposición prenatal al alcohol puede causar daño cerebral y otros problemas graves en los bebés. Debido a que no se conoce un nivel seguro de alcohol para un bebé en desarrollo, las mujeres que están embarazadas o que podrían estarlo no deben beber.\n"
          }
        }
      }
    },
