    "of1-5R-Xg5.text" : {
      "comment" : "Class = \"UILabel\"; text = \"When you quit smoking, it's totally normal for your appetite to go up a bit. Your body might not burn calories as fast, and you might find yourself eating more, maybe because quitting can be a bit stressful, or you just want something to do with your hands and mouth. Plus, food might taste even better since your sense of smell and taste aren't dulled by smoke\\n\\nHere's what you can do to manage it:\"; ObjectID = \"of1-5R-Xg5\";",
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "When you quit smoking, it's totally normal for your appetite to go up a bit. Your body might not burn calories as fast, and you might find yourself eating more, maybe because quitting can be a bit stressful, or you just want something to do with your hands and mouth. Plus, food might taste even better since your sense of smell and taste aren't dulled by smoke\n\nHere's what you can do to manage it:"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cuando dejas de fumar, es totalmente normal que tu apetito aumente un poco. Tu cuerpo puede no quemar calorías tan rápido, y podrías encontrar que comes más, quizás porque dejar de fumar puede ser un poco estresante, o simplemente porque quieres algo con lo que ocupar tus manos y boca. Además, la comida podría saber aún mejor ya que tu sentido del olfato y del gusto no están  Aquí tienes lo que puedes hacer para manejarlo:\n"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "OHd-Ha-HDa.text" : {
      "comment" : "Class = \"UILabel\"; text = \"What is tobacco?\"; ObjectID = \"OHd-Ha-HDa\";",
