    "RgN-pS-F7Y.text" : {
      "comment" : "Class = \"UILabel\"; text = \"If you have even tried to quit once in the past, you have some idea how it feels, the challenges you experienced, and what caused you to start smoking again. That means you’ve already tasted this journey and know how tricky it can be. There are small steps you can take now to help you quit for good and increase your chances of success. Learn the skills that will help you permanently achieve a tobacco-free life.\\n\\nIn the following sections, you can learn about recommended strategies for overcoming potential challenges you may encounter!\"; ObjectID = \"RgN-pS-F7Y\";",
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "If you have even tried to quit once in the past, you have some idea how it feels, the challenges you experienced, and what caused you to start smoking again. That means you’ve already tasted this journey and know how tricky it can be. There are small steps you can take now to help you quit for good and increase your chances of success. Learn the skills that will help you permanently achieve a tobacco-free life.\n\nIn the following sections, you can learn about recommended strategies for overcoming potential challenges you may encounter!"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Si has intentado dejarlo una vez en el pasado, tienes una idea de cómo se siente, los desafíos que experimentaste y qué te hizo empezar a fumar de nuevo. Eso significa que ya has probado este viaje y sabes lo complicado que puede ser. Hay pequeños pasos que puedes tomar ahora para ayudarte a dejarlo para siempre y aumentar tus posibilidades de éxito. Aprende habilidades que te ayudarán a lograr una vida libre de tabaco de manera permanente.  En las siguientes secciones, puedes aprender sobre las estrategias recomendadas para superar los desafíos potenciales que puedas encontrar.\n"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "RJn-yv-6On.text" : {
      "comment" : "Class = \"UILabel\"; text = \"Health problems\"; ObjectID = \"RJn-yv-6On\";",
