    "szw-q9-pvg.text" : {
      "comment" : "Class = \"UILabel\"; text = \"Focus on managing stress without turning to alcohol or quick fixes. Taking care of your body and mind will help you stay on track and reduce the urge to drink as a stress reliever.\"; ObjectID = \"szw-q9-pvg\";",
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Focus on managing stress without turning to alcohol or quick fixes. Taking care of your body and mind will help you stay on track and reduce the urge to drink as a stress reliever."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Concéntrate en manejar el estrés sin recurrir al alcohol o soluciones rápidas. Cuidar de tu cuerpo y mente te ayudará a mantenerte en el camino y reducir el impulso de beber como una forma de aliviar el estrés.\n"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "T2h-EY-YEN.text" : {
      "comment" : "Class = \"UILabel\"; text = \"Some signs of AUD are continuing to drink even though it is causing trouble with your family or at work, drinking more than you intended, having to drink more than before to get a desired effect, being unable to stop drinking after repeated attempts, or continuing to drink despite negative consequences. Signs of AUD may also include drinking to alleviate negative emotions such as feeling ”low” anxious, uneasy, unhappy, unwell, dissatisfied with life, or other negative emotions that were caused or worsened by alcohol misuse. Beyond these physical and mental health risks, frequent alcohol misuse also is linked with personal problems, such as losing one’s driver’s license or having relationship troubles.\"; ObjectID = \"T2h-EY-YEN\";",
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Some signs of AUD are continuing to drink even though it is causing trouble with your family or at work, drinking more than you intended, having to drink more than before to get a desired effect, being unable to stop drinking after repeated attempts, or continuing to drink despite negative consequences. Signs of AUD may also include drinking to alleviate negative emotions such as feeling ”low” anxious, uneasy, unhappy, unwell, dissatisfied with life, or other negative emotions that were caused or worsened by alcohol misuse. Beyond these physical and mental health risks, frequent alcohol misuse also is linked with personal problems, such as losing one’s driver’s license or having relationship troubles."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "\nAlgunos signos del TCA son seguir bebiendo aunque esto cause problemas con la familia o el trabajo, beber más de lo que se tenía previsto, necesitar beber más que antes para lograr el efecto deseado, no poder dejar de beber después de varios intentos, o seguir bebiendo a pesar de las consecuencias negativas. Los signos del TCA también pueden incluir beber para aliviar emociones negativas, como sentirse \"deprimido\", ansioso, incómodo, infeliz, mal, insatisfecho con la vida u otras emociones negativas causadas o empeoradas por el abuso del alcohol.\nMás allá de estos riesgos para la salud física y mental, el abuso frecuente de alcohol también está relacionado con problemas personales, como perder la licencia de conducir o tener problemas en las relaciones interpersonales..\n"
          }
        }
      }
    },
